&lt;h2&gt;Why join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your work directly shapes the product experience for hundreds of thousands of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small, high-caliber team, minimal bureaucracy, fast feedback loops, clear business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership and technical leadership as we scale internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat at the table in defining how frontend engineering evolves here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: #EMEA #APJ&lt;/li&gt;
